        <h1>My Hobby</h1>
        <p>
            I love reading non-fiction books about psychology, motivation, self-development and human behavior.
            These books help me understand people better and improve my communication skills, which is essential in HR.
        </p>
        <p>
            I also enjoy watching long interviews and podcasts where people talk openly about their careers, failures,
            successes and personal growth. I find it valuable because it teaches me empathy, perspective and emotional awareness.
        </p>
        <p>
            In my free time, I like analyzing workplace stories, HR cases and real-life situations involving communication,
            conflict or teamwork. It helps me naturally improve my HR thinking.
        </p>
